Error [jet.FieldWriteWithoutMarker]: A read `SharedGuard` cannot enter a write helper
  --> tests/ui/ownership/shared_read_guard_cannot_enter_write_helper.jet:9:10
    |
  9 |     bump(guard)
    |          ^^^^^
 Why: The helper can edit through this parameter, so its caller must hold an exclusive Shared guard
 Fix: Create the guard with `guard_edit()` before passing it to the helper
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0205
